### LEAVE MANAGEMENT

### APPLY FOR LEAVE (EMPLOYEE)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/leaves
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>
{
  "leaveTypeId": 2,
  "fromDate": "2025-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "toDate": "2025-02-03T00:00:00.000Z",
  "description": "I am suffering from fever."
}

### GET ALL LEAVE (USER)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

### GET ALL LEAVE (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/leaves/allLeave
Content-Type: application/json

### GET LEAVE BY ID (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/leaves/allLeave/4
Content-Type: application/json

### UPDATE LEAVE (ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/leaves/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "leaveTypeId": 2,
  "fromDate": "",
  "toDate": "",
  "description": ""
}


